    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/home-decor-store/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Home Decor Store is a beautifully designed, feature-rich theme crafted for home decor shops, furniture stores, interior designers, home styling studios, lifestyle boutiques, and luxury home furnishing brands. It’s perfect for showcasing modern furniture, decorative items, home accessories, wall decor, interior lighting, rugs, cushions, bedding, curtains, wall art, and home improvement products. Suitable for home renovation, interior design studios, decor showrooms, home makeovers, modern interiors, minimalistic home designs, boho home styles, vintage decor, home upgrades, and online furniture stores, this theme combines aesthetics and performance to deliver a seamless shopping experience. With a clean layout, elegant typography, and responsive design, it ensures your website looks stunning across all devices. Visitors can easily browse through categories like sofa sets, tables, chairs, shelves, mirrors, kitchen decor, outdoor furniture, planters, decorative lamps, vases, and wall shelves, with intuitive product filters and category sorting to simplify navigation. Each product page includes detailed descriptions, pricing, and high-resolution images, helping customers make confident purchases. Optimized for SEO, it boosts visibility for keywords like home decor shop, furniture store online, modern home interiors, interior design accessories, and luxury decor ideas. The theme also includes integrated features like shopping carts, wishlists, social media sharing, and product reviews, enhancing engagement and conversions. It supports popular plugins such as WooCommerce (for eCommerce management), YITH WooCommerce Wishlist (for customer favorites), Contact Form 7 (for customer inquiries), Elementor Header &amp; Footer Builder (for customization), Yoast SEO (for improved ranking), and Mailchimp (for marketing and newsletters). With flexible customization options for colors, fonts, headers, and layouts, store owners can align their website perfectly with their brand identity. Whether you specialize in handcrafted decor, luxury furnishings, minimalist furniture, or seasonal decor trends, the Home Decor Store Theme provides everything you need to build a captivating, functional, and profitable online decor business."
    },
